You are going to have to explain what rules you follow to get from a
to b. It might be clear to you, but it's not at all clear to me. In
the original there is only one value for test=1 goal=A V1, but here
you have six, four of which are missing. Why? Once you explain in
English how this works we can get to work on translating it into R.

>
> ...
>
